{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99676","id":2198422641,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6DCURx","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99676/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99676/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1b5101723d673dddbba3108ea849ecd8ae637d21","number":99676,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Channel Remap settings to ResourceImporterTexture","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11243\r\n\r\nDepends on #98071\r\nAlternative to #81803\r\n\r\nAdds color channel remap options to ResourceImporterTexture. These settings are part of the processing pass of the import operation, and allow discarding/replacing/overwriting the color channels of an imported image.\r\n\r\nThe following options are provided for each channel:\r\n- Red,\r\n- Green,\r\n- Blue,\r\n- Alpha,\r\n- Inverted Red,\r\n- Inverted Green,\r\n- Inverted Blue,\r\n- Inverted Alpha,\r\n- Unused (1 for alpha, 0 for others),\r\n- Zero,\r\n- One\r\n \r\nThe other processes (such as format optimization) happen after this one, which makes it possible to remove unneeded color channels (like alpha), and the following steps (like compression) will take that into account (for instance by compressing as DXT1 instead of DXT5).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github